ngs associated with these efforts.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2023 Q3","e":"eqt","d":"2023-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"Fourth, this superior operational execution is facilitating additional value creation potential on the Tug Hill assets, with EQT's team already improving drilling and completion efficiency by 40% in just 60 days of operating the assets, driving the potential for $150 per foot of well cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2023 Q4","e":"eqt","d":"2024-02-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Knop","x":"I think there is ample demand in that southeast market with data center build-outs really underpinned by the AI revolution right now and population growth in that area that’s really pulling on gas for just absolute power demand increases in addition to core retirement.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2023 Q4","e":"eqt","d":"2024-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"This recent performance suggests the potential for even more upside than the $150 per foot of well cost savings we discussed last quarter, which as a reminder, is additive to $80 million of largely infrastructure-related synergies we originally announced with the deal.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2023 Q4","e":"eqt","d":"2024-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"David Deckelbaum","x":"Is it implied cost savings?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q1","e":"eqt","d":"2024-04-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Roger Read","x":"And along those lines, the long-term demand here on the AI side, is there anything the data centers, let's call it, is there anything else you've seen recently or heard recently or any sort of direct outreach from consumers to EQT?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q2","e":"eqt","d":"2024-07-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Toby Rice","x":"MVP will also provide utilities access to cheap, reliable fuel to power America's data center and artificial intelligence buildout which is one of the strongest secular growth stories in the world.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q2","e":"eqt","d":"2024-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Toby Rice","x":"This efficiency improvement is resulting in tangible well cost savings as the average top-holed drilling cost on the Mallory C Pad came in 14% below our pre-drill estimate.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q2","e":"eqt","d":"2024-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Toby Rice","x":"As I mentioned previously, we believe the integration of EQT and Equitrans’ water systems can help sustain these completion efficiency improvements as streamlining water logistics is one of the most imperative elements to systematically increasing completed footage per day.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q3","e":"eqt","d":"2024-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Neil Mehta","x":"Just curious what your real-time assessment is around the AI and data demand -- data center theme?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q3","e":"eqt","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"But with our integration progress to-date, we have already achieved $145 million of annualized financial and corporate cost savings which is $25 million more than our original underwriting assumptions.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q3","e":"eqt","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Roger Read","x":"I think we've seen rumors in the in the press about MVP sale, if you're able to generate more cash just from operations in addition to the asset sales, what's the right way to think about how you would right-size the balance sheet?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2024 Q4","e":"eqt","d":"2025-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"These efficiency gains are carrying over into 2025, allowing us to drop from three to two frac crews in April as we are choosing to prioritize cost savings instead of production growth.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q1","e":"eqt","d":"2025-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"But now we've got a more bullish opportunity happening in our backyard with this AI data center thing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q1","e":"eqt","d":"2025-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Knop","x":"However, OPEC has decided to once again defend market share and start bringing back near record level of spare capacity, sending oil prices toward the 50s at the same time the trade war broke out.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q1","e":"eqt","d":"2025-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Knop","x":"Meanwhile, in the Haynesville, we still have not seen activity pick up and believe any activity additions will be disproportionately impacted by tariff-driven inflation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q2","e":"eqt","d":"2025-07-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Toby Z. Rice","x":"The project has secured a partner to build a colocated data center facility to support AI infrastructure and contemplate several phases of development beginning in 2027 and ramping through 2028, providing significant upstream growth optionality for EQT to meet increasing demand.","url":"https://s205.q4cdn.com/630272887/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/EQT-Q2-2025-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q2","e":"eqt","d":"2025-07-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Toby Z. Rice","x":"Once completed, Homer City will be the largest natural gas power plant ever built in North America, with an existing grid interconnection for added reliability to support AI data center loads across its 3,200 acre campus.","url":"https://s205.q4cdn.com/630272887/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/EQT-Q2-2025-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q2","e":"eqt","d":"2025-07-22","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Phillip Jungwirth","x":"Tariffs look like they could be quite high for producers.","url":"https://s205.q4cdn.com/630272887/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/EQT-Q2-2025-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q3","e":"eqt","d":"2025-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Toby Rice","x":"…approach to volume curtailments in response to volatile local pricing resulted in another quarter of significant price realization outperformance, with our corporate differential coming in $0.12 tighter than the midpoint of guidance despite local basis widening after we provided Q3 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/eqt-eqt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q3","e":"eqt","d":"2025-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Knop","x":"We will continue to look for ways to recycle structural cost savings into future growth, ensuring that our base dividend is bulletproof through commodity cycles.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/eqt-eqt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q3","e":"eqt","d":"2025-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Toby Rice","x":"An example of this is in the Deep Utica, where we drilled two wells during the third quarter at a pace that was nearly 30% faster than Olympus' historic performance, driving an estimated $2 million of per well cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/eqt-eqt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q4","e":"eqt","d":"2026-02-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Knop","x":"While not all these turbines are tied directly to data centers, meaningful portions are connected to new large load projects, including AI and cloud infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/eqt-eqt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q4","e":"eqt","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"Our tactical approach to volume curtailments and marketing optimization resulted in price realization outperformance throughout 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/eqt-eqt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2025 Q4","e":"eqt","d":"2026-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"That will continue to bear fruit and give opportunities for us to streamline logistics and operational efficiencies going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/eqt-eqt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2026 Q1","e":"eqt","d":"2026-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"While global markets are experiencing sharp price increases, American citizens and businesses continue to benefit from low-cost domestic supply, thanks to the shale revolution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/eqt-eqt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2026 Q1","e":"eqt","d":"2026-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Toby Rice","x":"So we'll continue to look for ways to streamline communications, and that's a normal part of our business in this large-scale organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/eqt-eqt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQT 2026 Q2","e":